pective domains, as is laid down in the legislation. Depending on the scheme, the funding decisions are made by the scientific councils, the Strategic Research Council (SRC) or the RCF’s subcommittees.\nWhat we do\nRCF Board\nThe Board of the Research Council of Finland decides the general policies and objectives of the RCF and allocates appropriations between the scientific councils.\nWhat we do\nScientific councils\nThe RCF’s four scientific councils of elected representatives award funding for research and researchers in the scientific councils’ respective fields.\nWhat we do\nStrategic Research Council\nThe SRC is an independent body established within the RCF that provides funding to programme-based research aimed at finding solutions to the major challenges facing Finnish society.\nOrganisational bodies Strategy and values What we do\nSubcommittees\nThe RCF Board has appointed a number of subcommittees as independent decision-making bodies. The subcommittees make decisions on funding that comes under the responsibility of several scientific councils.\nDo you have questions or feedback for us?\nContact us\nResearch Council of Finland\nHakaniemenranta 6\nPO Box 131\nFI-00531 Helsinki\nSwitchboard: +358 295 335 000\nRegistry: +358 295 335 100\nEmail: kirjaamo@aka.fi\nContact us\nInvoicing\nSubscribe to our newsletter\nData protection\nAccessibility statement\nAccessibility feedback\nWhistleblower protection\nDocument publicity\nCookie policy",
