s\nClosed\nScope\nIDRC requests expressions of interest for evaluators to conduct an evaluation of IDRC and the Global Partnership for Education’s (GPE) Knowledge and Information Exchange (KIX) program.\nThe main purpose of this evaluation is to inform GPE’s Board of Governors as it approaches decisions about future support and directions for KIX.\nEligibility\nMust have experience evaluating research for development programs/initiatives that facilitate evidence generation and use.\nMust have experience working in education systems strengthening in low- and middle-income countries.\nReady to apply?\nTo apply for this funding opportunity, you’ll need an account on SurveyMonkey Apply. If you don’t have an account yet, or need help with your existing one, please refer to our\nAccount setup guide\n.\nGet started\nShare this page\nStay connected.\nSubscribe\nIDRC / Eduardo Jalil, Panos Pictures\nFooter\nCareers\nContact Us\nDigital library\nMedia\nSub Footer Menu\nAccessibility\nEquality Statement\nOpen access policy\nPrivacy Notice\nResearch ethics\nTerms of use\nTransparency\n©\t2026\nIDRC",
