cil (SRC)\nis an independent body established within the RCF.\nGeneral RCF policies and objectives are decided by the\nRCF Board\n, which also allocates research appropriations to the scientific councils.\nView image in PDF format.\nAdministration Office\nThe Administration Office prepares and implements decisions made by the Board, the scientific councils, the Strategic Research Council, subcommittees and the President.\nThe President heads the day-to-day work at the Administration Office. The management also includes three executive directors. The RCF has three units:\nOperations Management Unit\nFunding Opportunities Unit\nImpact and Science Policy unit.\nThe approximately 110 officials at the Administration Office\nsee to the RCF’s administration\ndo all the necessary groundwork for official decision-making by the RCF Board and scientific councils, and execute the decisions\nprepare science policy surveys and plans\nparticipate in Finnish and international working groups.\nView image in PDF format.\nLearn more\nManagement\nDecision-making bodies\nStaff directory\nContact us\nPrint page\nShare page\nShare page\nDo you have questions or feedback for us?\nContact us\nResearch Council of Finland\nHakaniemenranta 6\nPO Box 131\nFI-00531 Helsinki\nSwitchboard: +358 295 335 000\nRegistry: +358 295 335 100\nEmail: kirjaamo@aka.fi\nContact us\nInvoicing\nSubscribe to our newsletter\nData protection\nAccessibility statement\nAccessibility feedback\nWhistleblower protection\nDocument publicity\nCookie policy",
